Z||000001||Phaeton||05-07-2000||04:01 AM||||Colors need to be matched with real lighting.<P>Auto paint dealers and body shops should have charts and maybe full spectrum lighting for exact matchups.<P>Dealerships would have paint chips for their respective offerings and unless you are set on the exact BMW color, a reasonable facsimile thereof could be found at GM or Ford.||||reg||12
